WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.152
- I hid this guy's glasses.

00:00:01.152 --> 00:00:01.985
- Hello.

00:00:01.985 --> 00:00:04.216
- And he's got two minutes to find them.

00:00:04.216 --> 00:00:05.049
Or else.

00:00:05.049 --> 00:00:05.882
- Or else what?

00:00:05.882 --> 00:00:07.132
- You're fired.

00:00:10.415 --> 00:00:13.397
- Uh, so I can only see things
that are like right here.

00:00:13.397 --> 00:00:15.252
Not here, or past that.

00:00:15.252 --> 00:00:16.585
Just right here.

00:00:21.427 --> 00:00:23.277
Ooh, God, it's so colorful.

00:00:23.277 --> 00:00:25.222
(playful music)

00:00:25.222 --> 00:00:27.480
(balls knocking)

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:28.313
No.

00:00:30.577 --> 00:00:31.410
Okay.

00:00:36.992 --> 00:00:37.825
Dammit.

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:51.848
(rumbling in box)

00:00:55.866 --> 00:00:57.564
What the hell is that?

00:00:57.564 --> 00:00:58.760
Is this for a printer?

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:02.260
(playful music speeds up)

00:01:06.470 --> 00:01:07.375
This is impossible.

00:01:07.375 --> 00:01:09.292
Did I check everything?

00:01:11.351 --> 00:01:13.851
(music slows)

00:01:15.746 --> 00:01:17.315
(bell dinging)

00:01:17.315 --> 00:01:18.648
All right, yeah.

00:01:23.558 --> 00:01:24.597
Great.

00:01:24.597 --> 00:01:27.180
(funky music)

